# Local env files must never reach the build. They pin VITE_BASE_URL to the
# absolute API origin, which the browser then blocks by CORS (the API only
# whitelists posmobile.vn and localhost). Without them the app falls back to
# "/api/v1" and goes through the rewrites in vercel.json.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.vercel
dist
node_modules
